## **4. Matrix Trace Calculation**
The **trace** is the sum of the diagonal elements.  
```c
#include <stdio.h>

int calculateTrace(int matrix[][10], int n) {
    int trace = 0;
    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
        trace += matrix[i][i];
    }
    return trace;
}

int main() {
    int n;
    printf("Enter the size of the square matrix: ");
    scanf("%d", &n);

    int matrix[10][10];
